(63, 13, 19, 13, 43, 18, 26, '{\"name\":{\"field_name\":\"Name\",\"field_type\":\"Input\",\"value\":\"Samm Simon\"},\"phone_number\":{\"field_name\":\"Phone number\",\"field_type\":\"Input\",\"value\":\"4169096181\"},\"email\":{\"field_name\":\"Email\",\"field_type\":\"Input\",\"value\":\"samm@sammsimon.ca\"},\"message\":{\"field_name\":\"Message\",\"field_type\":\"Text Area\",\"value\":\"Hi Creative Contractors team, I\'m Samm Simon writing on behalf of home.renovation.reviews, a community forum for homeowners and trades across Canada. We\'ve been adding verified profiles for renovation companies in Kelowna and would like to include yours. The listing is free. You\'d own it, collect reviews from real homeowners, and get referral traffic from the directory pages.\\r\\n\\r\\nA short FAQ on how claiming works is at https:\\/\\/home.renovation.reviews\\/t\\/most-commonly-asked-questions. That page explains what shows up on your profile and the moderation policy.\\r\\n\\r\\nOn a personal note, I\'m running 251 km this year to raise money for cancer research (sammsimon.ca if you\'re curious). The forum supports the run, and a lot of the trades there have backed the cause too. Either way, thanks for taking a look.\\r\\n\\r\\n\\u2014 Samm\"}}', '99.254.44.233', 'Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36', NULL, '2026-05-08 11:10:02', '2026-05-08 11:10:02', 'pending'),
