(148, 13, 15, 13, 49, 23, 32, '{\"name\":{\"field_name\":\"Name\",\"field_type\":\"Input\",\"value\":\"Mathieu Fonteijne\"},\"mobile_number\":{\"field_name\":\"Mobile Number\",\"field_type\":\"Number\",\"value\":\"3\"},\"email\":{\"field_name\":\"Email\",\"field_type\":\"Input\",\"value\":\"partnerships@thepinnacle.media\"},\"message\":{\"field_name\":\"Message\",\"field_type\":\"Text Area\",\"value\":\"Subject: A partnership idea for your ad accounts\\r\\nFor: Founder or Head of Growth\\r\\nHello, I\'m Mathieu, VP of Partnerships at Pinnacle Media. I\'m reaching out because your team runs paid campaigns, and we work with agencies doing exactly that. At The Pinnacle Media, we provide high-quality agency ad accounts on Meta, Google, and TikTok, built for teams like yours that want more stability and control as they scale.\\r\\n\\r\\nOur agency partners get no limits on ad spend, quick and free replacements if an account ever goes down, and priority support with direct access to the platform reps. It\'s the kind of setup that lets a growth team focus on campaigns instead of account logistics.\\r\\n\\r\\nWe\'d love to explore a partnership where The Pinnacle Media becomes your reliable accounts partner as you grow.\\r\\n\\r\\nWhat day\\/time would you be available for a partnership video call?\\r\\n\\r\\nBest,\\r\\nMathieu Fonteijne\\r\\nVP of Partnerships\"}}', '2803:2d60:1602:3839:fafc:287f:b8f3:55b4', 'Mozilla/5.0 (X11; CrOS x86_64 14541.0.0) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/149.0.0.0 Safari/537.36', NULL, '2026-07-15 21:38:02', '2026-07-15 21:38:02', 'pending'),
